stoat-desktop (1.5.4-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * debian.rules: override_dh_fixperms now runs dh_fixperms -Xchrome-sandbox; the plain chmod in dh_auto_install was reset by dh_fixperms, so the DEB shipped a 0755 sandbox. Proven with a real dh build in debian:sid: binary data tar carries -rwsr-xr-x root/root.

